    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dreamy adventure begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maid, dozing off during her break, finds herself in a mysterious dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Up Step Maid</i> is a 2D action game where you use three types of jumps to make your way through whimsical stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump through with three types of jumps</strong><br>If you press the jump button again just as you land from a normal jump, you'll perform a &quot;mid-jump.&quot;<br>Land from a mid-jump and press jump again to perform a &quot;high-jump&quot;!<br>Master all three jumps to overcome tricky obstacles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.poster.avif?t=1753344088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.webm?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.mp4?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but fun</strong><br>The stages offer a bit of a challenge, but there's no damage or game over.<br>You can retry as many times as you like, making it easy to enjoy even for players who aren't confident in action games.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable pixel-art maid</strong><br>The maid is brought to life with charming pixel art.<br>Her tiny, busy movements are irresistibly cute.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blend of 2D and 3D in a whimsical world</strong><br>Pixel-art characters meet 3D-crafted backgrounds to create a strange but adorable world that gives the game its unique charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a bit tough, but you'll keep coming back for more.<br>Run, jump, and explore the dream world together with the cute maid!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dreamy adventure begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maid, dozing off during her break, finds herself in a mysterious dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Up Step Maid</i> is a 2D action game where you use three types of jumps to make your way through whimsical stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump through with three types of jumps</strong><br>If you press the jump button again just as you land from a normal jump, you'll perform a &quot;mid-jump.&quot;<br>Land from a mid-jump and press jump again to perform a &quot;high-jump&quot;!<br>Master all three jumps to overcome tricky obstacles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.poster.avif?t=1753344088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.webm?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.mp4?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but fun</strong><br>The stages offer a bit of a challenge, but there's no damage or game over.<br>You can retry as many times as you like, making it easy to enjoy even for players who aren't confident in action games.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable pixel-art maid</strong><br>The maid is brought to life with charming pixel art.<br>Her tiny, busy movements are irresistibly cute.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blend of 2D and 3D in a whimsical world</strong><br>Pixel-art characters meet 3D-crafted backgrounds to create a strange but adorable world that gives the game its unique charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a bit tough, but you'll keep coming back for more.<br>Run, jump, and explore the dream world together with the cute maid!</p>",
